  "description": "Wallet is a market-leading personal finance manager, built to help you save money, plan for the future, and see all your finances in one place. See where your money goes by tracking expenses automatically with bank synchronization across all your accounts, currencies and investments. Dive into reports on your spending, manage debt, and track bills. Share specific features with loved ones to get on top of your budgets together.\n\nWallet allows you to see your finances your way: anywhere, any time.\n\nWhy People Love Wallet by BudgetBakers\nΓÇ£Helped me a lot with saving money. It's easy to use and user-friendly.ΓÇ¥ - Yasin Geddi\nΓÇ£Super!! Super Good app! Is stylish and easy to use! Definitely recommended for those who want to keep track of his expenses!ΓÇ¥ - Cedric Chevalier\nΓÇ£Superb for student expense, business and travelling or anything actuallyΓÇ¥ - Jakob Baumgartner\n\nWho Should Use Wallet\nTracking your spending just got a whole lot easier.  Toss your notebooks and spreadsheets, and budget for clear, tangible goals that are easy to track in real time. Wallet by BudgetBakers is not just an expense tracker or a budgeting app. ItΓÇÖs all about getting things under control now, so that you can make wise decisions and plan for the future - a month, a year, or 10 years down the line.\n\nWallet is designed to help you get your finances under control from day one, giving you ongoing insight into your financial situation, and helping you stay in control for the long term.\n\nPremium Features:\nAutomatic Bank Updates - Transactions are automatically and securely synced with your bank and smartly categorized. With 4,000 participating banks worldwide, youΓÇÖll save loads of time not having to track every penny.\nUnlimited accounts - Create as many accounts as you like. Add your bank accounts, vouchers, club cards, money in your pocket and track your expenses based on each account.\nInsightful reports - Easy-to-understand graphs and financial overviews give you actionable insights about the state of your finances, across bank accounts, credit and debit cards, debts, and cash.\nStock Tracking -  track your stock portfolio right in the app! Monitor the value of your stocks and  combine your holdings with other accounts and assets for an overview of your net worth.  Grow your wealth by building a diversified portfolio of stocks, ETFs and other funds.\nFlexible Budgeting - set one-time or recurring budgets, combining any category you want, and monitor your results on a daily basis.\n\n\nLIST OF OTHER FEATURES:\nΓùÅ Beautiful, clean & elegant design\nΓùÅ Detailed charts and reports\nΓùÅ Cloud synchronisation across all your devices and web interface\nΓùÅ Multiple currencies support\nΓùÅ Advanced record tracking\nΓùÅ Easy filtering and creating categories and templates\nΓùÅ Personalised category icons\nΓùÅ Full range of payment types\nΓùÅ Creating your own income/expense subcategories\nVisit our Terms of Service and Privacy policy at: https://budgetbakers.com/terms/\n\nHOW TO START USING WALLET\n1. Download the app\n2. Sign In Via Facebook or Email\n3. Get going: budget and track expenses like a master!\nWallet is certified with eTrust",
